WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Good morning.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.200
You're late again,
as usual.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.000
Wait... what time is it?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
"Don't forget," she said.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Hey!

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.400
What?!

00:59:58.000 --> 01:00:01.250
Spaces trimmed,  hard spaces kept

